## STEP 1 — DELTA
- [NEW] POST /oauth/token reveals professional client-auth gate: `client_id=1`, `4`, `5` with NO secret → JSON `{"error":"invalid_client","error_description":"Client authentication failed"}`. All three known clients are **confidential** — silent code-theft→exchange→ATO is **blocked** for these clients.
- [NEW] Nonexistent `client_id` (2,3,10,100,999,0,-1) → **unhandled Laravel 500** (error page), only subscribers 1/4/5 reach the OAuth validation path — those are the only real clients.
